URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/clubamsterdamklezmer-band/
SUMMARY:Club Amsterdam Klezmer ★ Amsterdam Klezmer Band 30 Years! ♫
DESCRIPTION:Club Amsterdam Klezmer ★ Amsterdam Klezmer Band 30 years!\nAK
 B live + Alec Kopyt\nDJ Chajes\nThursday 26.11.2026 @ Mezrab\nThe Amsterda
 m Klezmer Band returns to the Mezrab!\n\nFounded in 1996\, for three whole
  decades de Amsterdam Klezmer Band has been amongst the best klezmer and B
 alkan music has to offer to the global stage\, racking up over 2\,500 show
 s from Siberia via Western Europe all the way to Brazil.\n\nTherefore it's
  time for a proper celebration with our fans\, friends and family at our f
 avourite Mokum's club Mezrab!\n\nWith a massive discography of 20 albums u
 nder their belt\, these legends aren't just playing klezmer—they’re co
 mpletely reinventing it from the ground up\, injecting pure\, playful ener
 gy and capturing the music at its absolute peak of joy.\n\nThey effortless
 ly blend traditional hooks and original tracks\, all driven by the band’
 s unique\, irresistible powerhouse sound. We’re talking dark dances\, co
 lliding with infectious Sirba and cocek rhythms\, Motown grooves\, Turkish
  9/8 pulses\, jazz improv\, spoken word and rap!\n\nAKB is all about getti
 ng bodies moving\, sparking deep connections\, and keeping the klezmerbalk
 an vibe alive and kicking as a shared language. This night isn’t some no
 stalgic trip down memory lane—it’s a high-octane snapshot of where Ams
 terdam Klezmer Band is at right now: deeply rooted\, relentlessly creative
 \, and irresistibly alive!\n\nCome and party with us at Mezrab!\n\nListen 
 to the latest Asphalt Tango records AKB album "Diaspora" here:\nhttps://op
 en.spotify.com/album/0Uj4zkLsR8aNdXAVzZN028?si=28eCqVnARn-vS0vaha9rIQ&amp\
 ;nd=1&amp\;dlsi=6bcc2fe6f87f4087\n\n\nhttps://amsterdamklezmerband.bandcam
 p.com/\n\nDJ Chajes\nStraight from the heart of Mokum —spinning everythi
 ng from soulful global beats to absolute dancefloor madness!\n\n★\n\nDoo
 rs open: 20:00\nLive music: 21:00\nTickets: 15 EUR\nLimited online student
  tickets: 10 EUR  // SOLD OUT\n\n\nMUSIC TAGS\n#BALKAN\n#TURKISH\n#DUB\n#
 KLEZMER\n#PUNK\n#SKA\n#LIVE\n#DJ
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/AKB-EVENT-P
 IC-2026-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:04thursdays,display,music
END:VEVENT
