URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/vintage-voudou-november/
SUMMARY:Vintage Voudou dance night ★ Planet Ilunga Congo special + Listen
 ing in the dark session ♫
DESCRIPTION:\nVINTAGE VOUDOU Tropical Dance Party\nPlanet Ilunga Congo spec
 ial\nListening in the Dark session\nSaturday 28.11.26 @ Mezrab\n★\n\nAno
 ther edition of the grooviest and deepest vintage dance tunes from all aro
 und the world\, 100% vinyl!\n\n\n\n\n\nHosted by Edo Bouman\, special gues
 t: Bart Cattaert\n\nPlanet Ilunga is an independent Belgian record label f
 ocusing on music that is at first sight untranslatable. It specialises in 
 archiving\, documenting and sharing the “Rumba Lingala” sound from the
  fifties and sixties from both the Congos. Planet Ilunga wishes to contrib
 ute to restoring the rich Congolese music archive\, in the first place thr
 ough high quality vinyl records and extensive booklets.\n\nhttps://planeti
 lunga.bandcamp.com/\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JtkObGbtAOE\n\nhttp
 s://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y6O8TooK64o\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n★\n\n\nWe will sta
 rt this edition with a LISTENING SESSION IN THE DARK\, playing jaw droppin
 g songs from long lost times from distant lands. You can't get any deeper
  than this really!\n\n\nListening in the dark is a fantastic\, deep experi
 ence\, which we wholeheartedly invite you to.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n★\n\nDoor Op
 en: 21:00\n\nLISTENING SESSION IN THE DARK: 21:30-22:30\n\nTropical DJ set
 s: 22:30-01:45\n\nTickets: 10 EUR*\n\nLimited student tickets)  7\,50 EUR
 *\n\n*+0\,50 bank fee\n\n★\n@mezrab_\n@vintagevoudou\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/MoralesVV-1
 .0KLEIN.jpg
CATEGORIES:06saturdays,display,music
END:VEVENT
