URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/tell-then-show-our-storytelling-jam-6/
SUMMARY:Tell\, then show! – our storytelling jam
DESCRIPTION:Tell\, then Show! is an open storytelling evening where we sha
 re the stories behind our favourite songs\, films\, and books. What’s th
 e story you see when you hear that one track? Why does that scene or sen
 tence stick with you?\nEveryone is welcome to join in—but no pressure if
  you’d rather just listen.\nYou only have to bring three things: a song\
 , a short video and a book – and above all: tell us why you brought it.\
 nAfterwards\, we’ll briefly tune into the song or enjoy the clip togethe
 r.\n\nNo need for it to be your ultimate favorite song. It could be one yo
 u’re not fond of at all\, the one you hate most\, maybe even the most bo
 ring book you’ve flipped through\, or your mom’s treasured tune\, or t
 he funniest thing you’ve ever seen\, or the song that made you fall in l
 ove … the song that made you fall out of love\, a funny memory\, … jus
 t something you want to show to us!\n\n… as long as it comes with a stor
 y.\nGot the idea?\nWe also have two special guests sharing their own unfor
 gettable picks.\nCome tell\, or just come see. Tell\, then Show.\nDoors o
 pen at 19.00\, event starts at 20.00.\nDad is making soup.\nEntrance: Dona
 tions.\nLanguage: English.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/KAL_8272-1.
 jpg
CATEGORIES:07others
END:VEVENT
