URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/banda-entopica/
SUMMARY:Banda Entopica ★ Traditional Street Band from Greece ★ Salón S
 onoro ♫
DESCRIPTION:Banda Entopica ★ Traditional Street Band from Greece ★ Sal
 ón Sonoro\nThursday 3.12.2026 @ Mezrab\n★\nBanda Entopica – European 
 Tour\n\nBanda Entopica hails from Greece\, specifically from Thessaloniki
 —the city where the members met and the band was formed. All the musicia
 ns bring extensive experience from diverse musical genres\, which is clear
 ly reflected in their distinctive sound. The result is a vibrant and authe
 ntic blend of traditional and modern Balkan music\, centered around instru
 ments like the clarinet\, saxophone\, accordion\, and davul (large drum).\
 n\nThe live performances of Banda Entopica are a true experience—burstin
 g with energy and intense interaction with the crowd\, which explains the 
 widespread acclaim they have received from the very beginning. Sounds and 
 rhythms from Macedonia\, Thrace\, Epirus\, and the entire Balkan Peninsula
  come together to form an explosive mosaic of danceable music—at times e
 cstatic\, at times profound and celebratory. Their repertoire includes tra
 ditional songs from various regions as well as original compositions that 
 captivate audiences wherever they perform.\n\nThe word “Entopica” refe
 rs to the dialect of the Slavic-speaking populations of Macedonia\, common
 ly called “Ntopika” - in Greek\, meaning the local language\n\nThis se
 cond European tour aims to bring Banda Entopica's energy\, festive spirit\
 , and authentic Balkan sound to even more people\, building on the success
  of their first tour and opening up new musical pathways.\n\n 	Billy Maleg
 anos (Percussion)\n 	Konstantina Kioulou (Vocals)\n\n\n 	Christos Kiriaz
 is (Clarinet / Saxophone)\n 	Argyris Karagounis (Trumpet)\n 	Nikos Foutaki
 s (Accordion)\n\n\n 	Giannis Gkountanos (Sound Designer)\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nhtt
 ps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XHTzYjF1-J0\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/band
 a_entopica/\n\nSupport by DJ: Vasilis Migkoulis\n\n★\n\nDoors open: 20:0
 0\nConcert: 21:00\nTickets: 18 EUR\nLimited student discount tickets: 12\,
 50 EUR\n(0\,50 EUR bank fee)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/89ECDE6F-88
 0B-4321-8BD2-1556F04B2BD2.png
CATEGORIES:04thursdays,display,music
END:VEVENT
