SUMMARY:LGBTQ+ Stories
DESCRIPTION:\nLet’s come together for a night of queer stories!\nEvery ot
 her Thursday\, Mezrab brings together regulars and fresh faces to share st
 ories and music connected to LGBTQI+ experiences. Personal\, funny\, movin
 g\, strange or unexpected — all stories are welcome.\nStories bring us c
 loser\, help us see the world through someone else’s eyes\, and create c
 onnection. What better way to strengthen our community and stand up agains
 t bigotry than by sharing them?\nCome to tell\, come to listen\, or simply
  come to be part of the community.\nDoors open at 19.00\, event starts at 
 20.00.\nThere is soup.\nEntrance: Donations.\nLanguage: English.\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/DSC_0084-sc
 aled.jpg
