URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/cabaret-saalik-rabkah/
SUMMARY:Cabaret Saalik presents Rābkah ★ Swana Sounds ★ Libyan food 
 ★ Belly Dance ♫
DESCRIPTION:Cabaret Saalik presents Rābkah ★ Swana Sounds\nLibyan Food 
 ★ Belly dance ★ Stories ★ surprises..\nSaturday 12.12.2026 @ Mezrab\
 n★\n\nWe are happy to welcome the Cabaret Saalik crew to the Mezrab!\n\n
 Cabaret Saalik is a space to bring what you carry\, move how you feel\, an
 d share a presence. where music\, art\, stories and different worlds can m
 eet.\nRabkha is our first event\, bringing together Libyan food\, storytel
 ling\, belly dance and a musical journey from SWANA rhythms to unexpected 
 sounds.\n\nThe Libyan veggie menu is excluded and available for purchase a
 t the Cabaret Saalik table on the 12th\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/cabare
 t_saalik\n\nhttps://linktr.ee/cabaret_saalik\n\nhttps://soundcloud.com/jew
 e-almahdwe-447168341\n\n★\n\nDoors open at 20:30\n\nTickets program:  1
 1 EUR*\nTickets students (limited): 7\,50 EUR*\nTickets Food: 12 EUR  //
   Libyan full veggie 3 dishes Menu //  purchase at the Cabaret Saalik ta
