BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5137@mezrab.nl
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Amsterdam:20261214T200000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Amsterdam:20261214T220000
DTSTAMP:20261118T112816Z
URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/storytelling-solo-ben-haggerty-the-grateful-t
 he-dead/
SUMMARY:Storytelling Solo: Ben Haggerty\, the Grateful & the dead
DESCRIPTION:FAIRYTALES FOR GROWN-UPS:\nThe Grateful &amp\;amp\; The Dead\nP
 erformance Storytelling by BEN HAGGARTY\nSuitable for adults\n\nWe are ext
 remely proud to bring the storyteller who brought the art to a wider audie
 nce in the UK\, causing a storytelling revolution to our club.\n\n&nbsp\;\
 n\nBen Haggerty is world renowned for his playful performances\, allow Ben
  Haggarty to lure you into the richly metaphorical world of a full-blooded
  fairytale for grown-ups. Dark\, beautiful and startling by turn\, this is
  a story of dreams\, initiations and the repayment of debts – a journey 
 from innocence to experience\, which delves into a disconcertingly familia
 r narrative world\, complete with bizarre marriages and strange companions
 .\n\nBen Haggarty performs with infectious charm and ease – fierce\, fas
 t paced\, and unashamedly magical. This is a place where rules aren't brok
 en lightly...\n\n---\n\nBEN HAGGARTY: Having been trained in mime\, and in
  theatre direction at East 15\, and\napprenticed as an image-maker with We
 lfare State\, Ben is one of the UK’s most popular\ncontemporary storytel
 lers\, renowned for his passionate and physical performances. He\ntours wi
 dely\, has been a guest artist in over one hundred International Storytell
 ing Festivals\nin 32 countries and was for 10 years the official storytell
 er with Yo Yo Ma’s Silk Road\nEnsemble. Ben is a much sought after teach
 er and director of storytellers and artistic\ndirector of the legendary Cr
 ick Crack Club. He is Honorary Professor of Storytelling at the\nArts Univ
 ersity of Berlin (UDK). His graphic novel series ‘MeZolith' is published
  by Archaia.\nwww.benhaggarty.com\n\nDoors open at 19.00\, show starts at 
 20.00 (don't be late)\n\nThere is a generous discount for students!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/Grateful-de
 ad-flyer-2.jpg
CATEGORIES:07others
END:VEVENT
