URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/samizdat-stories-from-the-underground-2-2026-
 12-15/
SUMMARY:Samizdat: Stories from the Underground
DESCRIPTION:Samizdat:\n\nnoun\nthe clandestine copying and distribution of 
 literature banned by the state\, especially formerly in the communist coun
 tries of eastern Europe.\n"a samizdat newsletter"\n\nThe personal is polit
 ical. On this Tuesday storytelling night we tell stories\, often personal 
 ones\, that are directly related to the social and political struggles of 
 our times. The wars\, the revolutions\, the moments of liberation\, big an
 d small.\n\nDoors open at 19.00\, event starts at 20.00.\nDad is making so
 up.\nEntrance is whatever you think a night of connection and entertainmen
 t is worth.\nLanguage: English
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/KAL_4888-En
 hanced-NR.jpg
CATEGORIES:02tuesdays
END:VEVENT
