URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/tarab-machine/
SUMMARY:Tarab Machine live ★ Reinventing the golden age of Iraqi and Arab
  music ♫
DESCRIPTION:Tarab Machine live ★ Electrifying Middle Eastern Jazz &amp\; 
 Rock\nMagic Carpet Sessions x Salón Sonoro | Adventurous\, intimate &amp\
 ; crossing borders with music from around the world!\n★\n\nTARAB MACHINE
  is an ensemble that fuses the hypnotic pulse of Middle Eastern music with
  the raw energy of modern rock and the freedom of jazz improvisation. Anch
 ored by the voice and oud of Hussein\, the group builds bold bridges betwe
 en traditions\, blending haunting maqam melodies\, driving grooves\, and s
 himmering textures.\n\nTheir genre-bending approach and powerful live perf
 ormances have quickly earned them a place on the Belgian scene. Despite be
 ing a newly formed ensemble\, they have already appeared at major events\,
  including the Human’City Festival for BelRefugees (opening for Manu Cha
 o)\, Plazey Festival in Koekelberg\, and Brussels Jazz Weekend\, among oth
 ers.\n\nTogether\, they transform tarab — the Arabic word for musical ec
 stasy — into a living\, electrified experience.\n\nTARAB Machine present
 s its debut EP: a bold and immersive sonic journey that announces the path
  ahead. The ancestral wisdom of Iraqi folklore is their starting point\, a
 nd the powerful arrangements are their vehicle. Whilst it lifts us up\, th
 e potent mystical psychedelia grounds us in our bodies\, back down to our 
 feet\, because the spiritual quest is no obstacle to a good dance!\n\nHUSS
 EIN RASSIM- Voice &amp\; Oud\nSKANDER JENHANI - Guitar\nLUISMI AGUILAR- Cl
 arinet\nLESTER STEIN - Bass\nNIKLAS VON WERNE - Drums\n\nhttps://www.youtu
 be.com/watch?v=crorpJM7HMo\n\nhttps://tarabmachine.tilda.ws/\nhttps://tara
 bmachine.bandcamp.com/album/tarab-machine\nhttps://www.instagram.com/tarab
 _machine\n\n★\n\nDoors open: 20:00\nConcert: 21:00\nTickets: 14\,50 EUR*
 \nStudent discount tickets (limited): 10 EUR*\n\n*including 0\,50 EUR bank
  fee\n\nMUSIC TAGS\n#ARABIC\n#JAZZ\n#IRAQI\n#ROCK\n#FUSION\n#FOLK
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/Sj.Photogra
 phe-event-picture-taraab-machine-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:04thursdays,display,music
END:VEVENT
