SUMMARY:NEW YEAR'S EVE PARTY ★ TROPICAL MEZQUERADE
DESCRIPTION:NYE ★ TROPICAL MEZQUERADE PARTY\nThursday 31.12.2026 @ Mezrab
 \n★\nYes\, we're back!\nAfter a whirlwind Back to the Dada Future year\,
  we're returning to our beloved Masquerade aka Mezquerade theme...\n\nAnd 
 this time\, it's going TROPICAL 🌴\n\nDress &amp\; paint up\, get maske
 d\, bring your friends &amp\; join us as we celebrate the last night of th
 e year and the first day of the new!✨ 🍾 🌈\n\n★\n\nSTORYTELLERS 
 &amp\; PERFORMANCES\nexciting\, real &amp\; extraordinary cultural tigers 
 performing around the Mez 🪎\n\nLive MEMO PIMIENTO\na frantically happy 
 &amp\; fun complementary electro-cumbia duo 🐠🍍\n\nMEMO: Mexican musi
 cian and producer\nbrings from Mexio-City\nwarm and latin energy\ninto ele
 ctronic dance floors\n\nAnd his pepper:\nMANON: contagious and frenetic.\n
 The master vibe. MC that electrifies.\n\nRebooting Latin Sounds: Cumbia Sa
 lsa Reggaeton Tribal Drum &amp\; Bass Trap\n\n\nDJs\nEastern Horizons &amp
 \; Zé Karlo\nHit Sounds from the Tropical hemisphere\, travelling all the
  way back towards the East.\nAnd Britney Spears..\n\nBubble &amp\; smoke m
 achines galore! 🪗 💥\n\n★\n\nDoors open:  20:00\n\nEarly bird Tick
 ets: 15 EUR\n\nTropical Mezquerade Tickets: 20 EUR\n\nincluding a free gla
 ss of Bubbles!!  Whoohoo\nincluding 0\,50 EUR bank fee...d'oh
