URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/the-original-mezrab-comedy-night-32/
SUMMARY:The Original Mezrab Comedy Night
DESCRIPTION:Step right up\, ladies and gentlemen\, comedy aficionados and l
 aughter enthusiasts! 🎉\nGet ready to embark on a rollercoaster of hilar
 ity at the Original Mezrab Comedy Night! 🤣🎤\nEvery first Saturday of
  the month\, we're turning up the laughter dial and bring you an unforgett
 able evening packed with side-splitting performances from international co
 medy daredevils and homegrown talents that are shooting for the comedy sta
 rs! 🌟🌍\n\nPicture this: a cozy cocoon right in the heart of Amsterda
 m – the Mezrab\, where laughter echoes off the walls and good times are 
 in generous supply. 🎭✨ But hey\, this isn't your average Saturday nig
 ht Netflix binge. No\, no! This is the real deal\, the genuine article\, t
 he crème de la crème of comedy experiences. 🚀 Whether you're an inter
 national jetsetter or a local in the know\, Mezrab Comedy Night is your ti
 cket to a world of laughter\, love\, and levity. 🌎❤️ And guess what
 ? You're not alone! Bring your posse of pals\, your chums\, your amigos\, 
 and let's create a comedy community like no other. Enjoy a satisfying bowl
  of soup and keep the drinks flowing from our fully stocked bar. It's a ni
 ght of laughter\, good company\, and culinary delights all rolled into one
 . Join us for an unforgettable evening! 🍲🥂🤣\n\nNow\, let's talk s
 eats – these gems are limited\, prime real estate\, and they're calling 
 your name!\nMark your calendar\, set those reminders – The Original Mezr
 ab Comedy Night is THE night.\n\nTickets: 13.50 EUR (+0\,50 bank fee)\n\nD
 oors open at 19.00\nEvent starts at 20.00\nSoup: YES!\nLanguage: English
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/KAL_4512-En
 hanced-NR-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:06saturdays
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4917@mezrab.nl
DTSTART:20270105T180000Z
DTEND:20270105T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20261030T123313Z
URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/mythos-ancient-tales-from-all-around-the-worl
 d-2027-01-05/
SUMMARY:Mythos. Ancient tales from all around the world.
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Mythos\, the storytelling night in the Mezrab that c
 elebrates the ancient. We go beyond today's stories by asking a few of our
  tellers to dive into world myths. Rich and varied as they are\, each mont
 h we pick a different world tradition\, and ask tellers to pick a tiny yar
 n to dive into. Expect a varied night full of surprises!\n\nDoors open: 19
 :00\nShow starts: 20:00\nSoup: Yes.\nEntrance donation based
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/KAL_4598-En
 hanced-NR.jpg
CATEGORIES:02tuesdays
