URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/mezrab-at-verkadefabriek-resistance/
SUMMARY:Mezrab at Verkadefabriek: Resistance
DESCRIPTION:\n\nFor thousands of years\, people have gathered to share stor
 ies: to entertain\, to pass on wisdom\, to make sense of the world\, and t
 o connect with one another. Mezrab - a beloved storytelling theater from A
 msterdam - invites you to experience this timeless tradition in Den Bosch!
 \n\n\n\n\nExpect to hear stories that will make you laugh till you cry\, s
 tories that will have you holding your breath in anticipation\, and storie
 s that will stay with you long after the evening is over. The host of the 
 evening will be Sahand Sahebdivani.\n\nAll stories are in English. The eve
 ning includes a break in the middle: you're welcome to grab a drink and ch
 at with a stranger!\n\n\nJanuary 15\nTonight will be all about Resistance.
  Join us for stories of courage\, struggles for freedom\, acts of defiance
  and revolutions!\n\nWHERE: Verkadefabriek\, den Bosch\nTICKETS ARE HERE
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/sahand-verk
 adefabriek-header-scaled.png
CATEGORIES:mezelse
END:VEVENT
