SUMMARY:Mythos. Ancient tales from all around the world.
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Mythos\, the storytelling night in the Mezrab that c
 elebrates the ancient. We go beyond today's stories by asking a few of our
  tellers to dive into world myths. Rich and varied as they are\, each mont
 h we pick a different world tradition\, and ask tellers to pick a tiny yar
