URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/koyaman-live/
SUMMARY:Koyaman live ★ Electro-Eastern Mediterranean Dub ★ Salón Sonor
 o ♫
DESCRIPTION:Koyaman live ★ Salón Sonoro\nThursday 18.02.2027 @ Mezrab\n
 “Koyaman: When Tradition Meets a Psychedelic Tapestry of Sounds”\n★\
 n\nKoyaman is a genre-bending trio that redefines Eastern Mediterranean tr
 aditional music by blending it with hypnotic grooves\, psychedelic texture
 s\, and electronic elements. Using the oud\, kanun\, and an eclectic set o
 f percussion instruments\, the band creates a fresh\, vibrant and danceabl
 e soundscape where tradition meets dub\, breakbeats and urban psychedelia.
 \n\nTheir music draws on the traditions of Greece\, the Balkans and the Ea
 stern Mediterranean\, while embracing improvisation\, looping\, electronic
  processing and contemporary rhythmic language. The result is a live exper
 ience that is energetic\, playful and deeply rooted in tradition without b
 eing bound by it.\n\nKOSTAS TSAROUCHIS — OUD\, LOOPS &amp\; ELECTRONICS\
 nYIANNIS RIZOPOULOS — DRUMS\, WORLD PERCUSSION &amp\; ELECTRONIC PADS\nM
 ANOLIS CHRISTODOULOU — KANUN\, LOOPS &amp\; ELECTRONICS\n\nhttps://www.y
 outube.com/watch?v=3k_Vlycu2Kw\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ukhpjnOz
 HD4\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HxEDVcblcdk\n\nhttps://www.instagra
 m.com/koyamanband/\n\n★\n\nDoors open: 20:00\nKoyaman live: 21:00\nTicke
 ts: 15 EUR\nLimited student tickets: 10 EUR\nTickets door: 18 EUR\n\n*tick
 ets including 0\,50 EUR bank fee\n\nMUSIC TAGS\n#GREEK\n#DUB\n#URBAN\n#KAN
 UN\n#ELECTRONIC\n#BALKAN\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/event-pictu
 re-static-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:04thursdays,display,music
END:VEVENT
