SUMMARY:El Búho live ★ Gypsy Box and Meraki ★ Salón Sonoro
DESCRIPTION:El Búho live ★ Gypsy Box and Meraki ★ Salón Sonoro\nHogar
  album release\nSatuday 20.03.2027\n★\nWe are excited to welcome El Búh
 o back to Mezrab! This time\, he will be performing alongside two amazing 
 support DJs: Gypsy Box and Meraki.\n\n\nFollowing his 2018 set during our 
 Electronic Tales From Beyond night with Kako da Ne and Chidi Onwuku\, "the
  owl" returns to share his new album\, Hogar.\nExpect the sounds of nature
 \, folklore\, and deep electronica from this incredible producer\, DJ\, an
 d former Amsterdammer :)\n\n\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\nhttps://www.sonidoelbuho.com/
 about\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UBIn0BpgGM0\n\nDj Gypsy Box\nhttp
 s://soundcloud.com/gypsy-box/how-to-fly\n\n\n\nDj Meraki\nhttps://thekaris
 matik.com\n\n\n\nPoster design:  https://www.instagram.com/mao_orsini/\n\
 n★\n\nEarly bird tickets: 18\,50 EUR\n\nRegular tickets: 22\,50 EUR\n\nD
 oors: 21:00\n\nDoors close: 02:00
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/el-buho_mez
 rab_print-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:06saturdays,display,music
