URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/the-mezjam-2027-06-13/
SUMMARY:The MezJam
DESCRIPTION:Don't you think it's time to jam together again?\nEvery second 
 Sunday evening of the month\, the finest and best musicians from all over 
 the world come together and go wild with their instruments.\nAnd you know 
 what: you can be right in the middle of it. Bring your harp\, trumpet\, bu
 gle\, setar or Steinway Grand Piano and join in.\n\nWe have no idea where 
 the tunes will take us\, and that's exactly what we like so much here at M
 ezrab.\n\nThe hosts for this evening is Babak Amiri.\n\nThe Sunday Mez Jam
  ♫\nThree sets of music from around the world.\n\nDoors open at 19.00\, 
 event starts at 20.00.\nDad is making soup.\nEntrance: Donations.\nLanguag
 e: English.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/KAL_8203-sc
 aled.jpg
CATEGORIES:07others
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4950@mezrab.nl
DTSTART:20270615T180000Z
DTEND:20270615T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20261030T123416Z
URL:https://mezrab.nl/events/samizdat-stories-from-the-underground-2-2027-
 06-15/
SUMMARY:Samizdat: Stories from the Underground
DESCRIPTION:Samizdat:\n\nnoun\nthe clandestine copying and distribution of 
 literature banned by the state\, especially formerly in the communist coun
 tries of eastern Europe.\n"a samizdat newsletter"\n\nThe personal is polit
 ical. On this Tuesday storytelling night we tell stories\, often personal 
 ones\, that are directly related to the social and political struggles of 
 our times. The wars\, the revolutions\, the moments of liberation\, big an
 d small.\n\nDoors open at 19.00\, event starts at 20.00.\nDad is making so
 up.\nEntrance is whatever you think a night of connection and entertainmen
 t is worth.\nLanguage: English
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mezrab.nl/wp-content/uploads/KAL_4888-En
 hanced-NR.jpg
CATEGORIES:02tuesdays
END:VEVENT
