SUMMARY:The ALT Mezrab Comedy Night
DESCRIPTION:This is our brand new show in Mezrab!\nGet ready for a comedy s
 how like never before!\nIt's not just people who say funny things: No\, th
 ere are also puppets\, improv\, scenes from movies\, headstands\, tarring 
 and feathering - everything that justifies the ALT in the title.\nAn eveni
 ng where things happen that are only remotely comedy\, and yet are funny a
 s bread.\nAnd\, before we forget to mention it: We also have people saying
  funny things.\n\nBetter grab your tickets fast\, because they'll disappea
 r quicker than at a magic show.\n\nTickets: 13.50 EUR (+0\,50 bank fee)\n\
